182301,"Yahya related to me from Malik that he had heard that the Messenger of Allah, may Allah bless him and grant him peace, entered the mosque and found Abu Bakr as-Siddiq and Umar ibn al-Khattab there. He asked them and they said, ""Hunger has brought us out."" The Messenger of Allah said, ""Hunger has also brought me out."" So they went to Abu'l-Haytham ibn at-Tayyihan al-Ansari. He ordered some barley which he had to be prepared, and he stood up to"
