182901,"It was narrated to me from Malik, from Yahya ibn Sa'id, that he heard Al-Qasim ibn Muhammad say: A man came to Abdullah ibn Abbas and said to him: \I have an orphan"
182902,"Al-Qasim ibn Muhammad used to say: I met people, and they did not marvel at speech."
